      "text": "外十八格 - 润下格",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c124:p0002",
      "sha256": "2bafb696ada8c0dc0297c799c48b8dd82eceb790eb7982a4db868c36cd41646a"
    },
    {
      "section": "外十八格-润下格",
      "text": "且如壬癸日，要申子辰全或亥子丑全是也，忌辰戌丑未官乡，喜西方运，不宜东南，怕冲克，岁运同。润下者，天干地支浑是水，如湖海汪洋，望以无际，主人清秀量宏。倘遇土运，必主淹滞，若生於冬月者，又为奇特者也。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c124:p0003",
      "sha256": "80aaafa138ed842c803058afd3471c7371e05e6d6d067a2d1fd26f41020db1a0"
    },
    {
      "section": "外十八格-润下格",
      "text": "万宗人，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c124:p0004",
      "sha256": "207982122e4adc812b87863800aa1f444212e21c3fc7bfaa33bcc22c85649b8b"
    },
    {
      "section": "外十八格-润下格",
      "text": "庚子 庚辰 壬申 辛亥",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c124:p0005",
      "sha256": "b966735666840447037cc82f6ca027883e7c66686fae06f202025eafb9f1ad82"
    },
    {
      "section": "外十八格-润下格",
      "text": "眉批：生临壬癸水局中，汪洋又会向流东，若然不遇堤防土，金紫荣身位至公。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
